Jail networking examples for HalfBSD
===================================

The kernel includes VIMAGE. jib and jng can be used with jail.conf(5) to prepare
network interfaces. Customize jail.xxx.conf for the intended root and bridge.
Use native jail(8) directly or provide an explicit HalfBSD service definition
with initialization and cleanup policy. Automatic RC jail startup and RC-format
configuration examples have been removed. These examples do not register a
service or change the running system automatically.
